+  //     restored row came first ("切换 Space 的时候，它会跳到我上一次打开的那个标签页").
+  //     No path wakes a row on the user's behalf; a space with nothing loaded
+  //     gets a blank page (step 3). One exception: a sleeping *blank* page is
+  //     this space's own landing page from before the restart -- reusing it
+  //     costs nothing and keeps blank rows from piling up, one per restart.
